<h2 style="text-align: center;">BUILD A GREAT BUSINESS</h2>
<p>You have a great product, we have a 100-day program to show you how to build a great business. Velocity&#8217;s accelerator program will teach you how to discover, develop and close customers, build strategic partnerships and raise money to take your idea to the next stage of growth. Here are a few things that founders talk about after their Velocity experience.</p>
